    "body": "The help text didn't show how to use `max-connections` with the default Unix socket.\n\nThis change adds a `unix:,max-connections=8` example and explains that the colon is required.\n\nTested:\n- `bitcoin-node -help` shows the updated text.\n- Tested on regtest and confirmed that the default socket gets 8 connection slots.\n\nFixes #36657",
